          "patch_summary": "The patch is part of a larger series that addresses issues related to zoned block devices and Btrfs. Specifically, it appears to be fixing problems with the allocator in non-zoned environments, where metadata typically uses the clustered allocator. The patch itself does not provide detailed information about its contents or changes.",
